---
import '../styles/v3-pages.css';
import V3CommercialHeader from '../components/V3CommercialHeader.astro';
import V3CommercialFooter from '../components/V3CommercialFooter.astro';
import V3Seo from '../components/V3Seo.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const demo = `${base}demo/`;
const pilot = `${base}piloto/`;
const security = `${base}seguridad/`;
---
<!doctype html><html lang="es"><head>
<V3Seo title="Contacto · IsiVoltPro" description="Vista segura del futuro canal de contacto de IsiVoltPro, con recogida de datos personales desactivada hasta completar privacidad, consentimiento y backend." path={`${base}contacto/`} />
<style is:inline>
.contact-board{min-height:100svh;background:radial-gradient(circle at 18% 70%,rgba(65,199,153,.08),transparent 24%),radial-gradient(circle at 45% 28%,rgba(109,88,225,.08),transparent 22%),#fff}.contact-main{padding:58px 0 70px}.contact-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.74fr 1.26fr;gap:54px;align-items:center}.contact-left h1{margin:12px 0 14px;font:800 clamp(36px,3.55vw,49px)/1.01 var(--v3-font-display,system-ui);letter-spacing:-.058em}.contact-left h1 span{display:block;color:transparent;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6658de,#49a9d1 52%,#35bd8e);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text}.contact-left>p{max-width:420px;margin:0;color:#747f91;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65}.contact-kicker{display:inline-flex;padding:6px 9px;border:1px solid #e9ecf3;border-radius:999px;color:#70798a;font-size:8px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.contact-methods{display:grid;gap:10px;margin:21px 0}.contact-method{display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:center}.contact-method i{width:34px;height:34px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:11px;background:#f1efff;color:#6854db;font-style:normal}.contact-method:nth-child(2) i{background:#eaf9f3;color:#22a777}.contact-method:nth-child(3) i{background:#eef7fb;color:#2c9ab5}.contact-method strong{display:block;font-size:10px}.contact-method small{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:#8992a1;font-size:8px;line-height:1.35}.contact-people{position:relative;width:min(315px,100%);height:190px;margin-top:18px;border-radius:22px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f4f6ff,#f4f0ff 55%,#ecfaf5);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 18px 42px rgba(61,69,107,.08)}.contact-people img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.contact-people::before{content:'';position:absolute;z-index:1;left:22px;top:22px;width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(105,88,222,.16),rgba(52,191,143,.10));pointer-events:none}.contact-card{position:relative;padding:25px;border:1px solid #e7eaf2;border-radius:20px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 24px 64px rgba(56,64,103,.11)}.contact-card__top{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;margin-bottom:16px}.contact-card h2{margin:0;font-size:17px}.contact-card__top p{margin:4px 0 0;color:#8a93a2;font-size:8px;line-height:1.5}.contact-lock{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:15px;padding:10px 11px;border:1px solid #e7eaf2;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f8faff,#f8f6ff);color:#68748a;font-size:8px;line-height:1.45}.contact-lock i{width:27px;height:27px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:9px;background:#efedff;color:#6650d8;font-style:normal}.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.form-preview{border:0;padding:0;margin:0}.field{display:grid;gap:5px}.field--wide{grid-column:1/-1}.field label{font-size:8px;font-weight:800;color:#566176}.field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;padding:10px 11px;border:1px solid #e2e6ee;border-radius:8px;background:#f8f9fc;color:#7b8597;font-size:9px;outline:0;-webkit-text-fill-color:#7b8597}.field textarea{min-height:100px;resize:none}.contact-actions{margin-top:12px}.contact-actions .btn{width:100%;min-height:44px;background:#111827!important;border-color:#111827!important;color:#fff!important}.contact-actions button[disabled]{opacity:.78;cursor:not-allowed}.contact-state{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#eaf9f3;color:#1e9f70;font-size:7px;font-weight:850}.contact-links{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:17px}.contact-links .btn{min-height:44px;border-radius:9px;font-size:10px;padding-inline:15px}.contact-links .btn--primary{background:#111827;border-color:#111827;color:#fff}
@media(max-width:900px){.contact-main{padding:64px 0 78px}.contact-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}.contact-left{max-width:650px}.contact-left h1{font-size:clamp(43px,8vw,58px)}.contact-left>p{font-size:13px}.contact-people{display:none}.contact-card{padding:30px}}@media(max-width:560px){.contact-main{padding:54px 0 66px}.contact-layout{gap:30px}.contact-card{padding:20px 16px;border-radius:18px}.form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.field--wide{grid-column:auto}.contact-left h1{font-size:clamp(41px,12vw,52px)}.contact-links{flex-direction:column}.contact-links .btn{width:100%}}
</style></head><body class="contact-board"><V3CommercialHeader />
<main class="contact-main"><div class="page-shell contact-layout">
<section class="contact-left"><span class="contact-kicker">Contacto</span><h1>Hablemos de<span>tu proyecto.</span></h1><p>La experiencia comercial ya permite explorar IsiVoltPro, el piloto y su enfoque de seguridad. El canal real de recogida de solicitudes seguirá cerrado hasta disponer de privacidad, consentimiento y destino seguro de los mensajes.</p><div class="contact-methods"><div class="contact-method"><i aria-hidden="true">▣</i><div><strong>Demo del producto</strong><small>Recorre el producto con información ficticia y sin registro.</small></div></div><div class="contact-method"><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i><div><strong>Piloto acotado</strong><small>Valida un problema concreto antes de hablar de contratación.</small></div></div><div class="contact-method"><i aria-hidden="true">◇</i><div><strong>Privacidad primero</strong><small>No se recogen datos personales mientras el canal no esté listo.</small></div></div></div><div class="contact-links"><a class="btn btn--primary" href={demo}>Ver demo</a><a class="btn" href={pilot}>Ver piloto</a><a class="btn" href={security}>Seguridad</a></div><div class="contact-people" aria-hidden="true"><img src={`${base}media/contact-team-isivoltpro.svg`} alt=""/></div></section>
<section class="contact-card" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><div class="contact-card__top"><div><h2 id="contact-title">Cuéntanos qué necesitas</h2><p>Vista previa visual del futuro formulario de contacto.</p></div><span class="contact-state">● Desactivado por privacidad</span></div><div class="contact-lock" id="form-state" role="status"><i aria-hidden="true">🔒</i><span><strong>No introduzcas datos personales todavía.</strong> Los campos están desactivados y esta página no envía ni almacena información.</span></div><form aria-describedby="form-state"><fieldset class="form-preview" disabled aria-label="Vista previa del futuro formulario de contacto"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="name">Nombre</label><input id="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Nombre" /></div><div class="field"><label for="business">Empresa</label><input id="business" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Empresa / actividad" /></div><div class="field"><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="nombre@empresa.com" /></div><div class="field"><label for="phone">Teléfono</label><input id="phone" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="Opcional" /></div><div class="field field--wide"><label for="profile">Perfil</label><select id="profile"><option>Selecciona un perfil</option><option>Autónomo</option><option>Pequeño equipo</option><option>Empresa mantenedora</option><option>Instalaciones propias</option></select></div><div class="field field--wide"><label for="need">¿En qué podemos ayudarte?</label><textarea id="need" placeholder="Describe brevemente qué quieres organizar mejor"></textarea></div></div></fieldset><div class="contact-actions"><button class="btn" type="button" disabled>Enviar mensaje · próximamente</button></div></form></section>
</div></main><V3CommercialFooter /></body></html>